OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785782911
OL,3,CPeople advised to avoid water due to
OL,4,Csewage pollution
OL,6,FPeople in Cornwall have been urged to
OL,7,Favoid swimming at Polstreath Beach
OL,8,Funtil further notice after the
OL,9,FEnvironment Agency confirmed a risk of
OL,10,Fsewage pollution in the water.
OL,12,FThe South and South West branch of the
OL,13,FEA issued the warning on Sunday (2
OL,14,FAugust), which has not yet been lifted.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/5
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
