OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40302
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785782911
OL,3,CPeople advised to avoid water due to
OL,4,Csewage pollution
OL,6,FThe authority said it was reported on
OL,7,FSunday afternoon that there was sewage
OL,8,F"entering a stream that flows into
OL,9,FMevagissey Harbour and out to
OL,10,FPolstreath Beach" and stated that
OL,11,Fphotos showed a "cloudy discharge"
OL,12,Ffrom a surface water drain.
OL,14,FThe statement reads: "Our officers
OL,15,Fattended the site and confirmed this
OL,16,Fwas raw sewage, based on visual and
OL,17,Fodour assessment, ammonia readings,
OL,18,Fand water quality monitoring.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/5
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40303
SC,0003
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785782911
OL,3,CPeople advised to avoid water due to
OL,4,Csewage pollution
OL,6,F"We've collected water samples and
OL,7,Fphotographic evidence and are
OL,8,Fcontinuing our investigation."
OL,10,FSouth West Water (SWW) is
OL,11,Finvestigating the source, with the EA
OL,12,Fstating they will "continue to monitor
OL,13,Fthe situation, work with SWW to stop
OL,14,Fthe pollution, and keep the public
OL,15,Finformed".
OL,17,FThe EA also shared a separate warning
OL,18,Fon Monday (3 August) after officers
OL,19,Fresponded to a sewage spill in St
OL,20,FMawes.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/5
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
OL,23,TppppppppppppppppppGsource: itv.com/news
OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40304
SC,0004
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785782911
OL,3,CPeople advised to avoid water due to
OL,4,Csewage pollution
OL,6,FThe statement reads: "Sewage is being
OL,7,Ftaken away by tanker while South West
OL,8,FWater repair a pipe which burst on
OL,9,FSunday evening.
OL,11,F"We would advise against going into
OL,12,Fthe water for recreation as sewage is
OL,13,Fstill present in the harbour area.
OL,14,FPlease follow instructions on signage
OL,15,Fby the harbour master for latest
OL,16,Fupdates."
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G4/5
OL,2,W,.!+.-' "-$/*%+.!+,*%/*%/*-'T(,,,,,,,,,
