OL,24,ANext Page BSW Eng NewsCThis Day FReg TV
FL,404,400,120,260,000,100
PN,40305
SC,0005
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F403A1785782911
OL,3,CPeople advised to avoid water due to
OL,4,Csewage pollution
OL,6,FIt comes as SWW is due to face
OL,7,Fsentencing this week after pleading
OL,8,Fguilty to 18 charges of water
OL,9,Fpollution in Devon and Cornwall over a
OL,10,Fsix-year period.
OL,12,FThe offences took place between
OL,13,FJanuary 2015 and July 2021 in five
OL,14,Flocations: Bodmin, Harlyn, Playing
OL,15,FPlace, Polperro and Plymouth.
OL,1,W~s1j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G5/5
